        "audit-service is a RabbitMQ consumer. A serverless function only runs while an HTTP request is in flight, so durable event consumption requires a queue provider that can push over HTTPS (see QUEUE_PROVIDER in .env.vercel.example). Without it, audit rows are only written by direct HTTP calls."
